        "content": "### Phase 2: AI Brain (RAG Agent)\n**Model:** Google Vertex AI.\n**Role:** QA Performance Analyst.\n**Strict Rules:**\n1. Treats the *first word* of input as the Agent Name.\n2. **MUST** use the Vector Tool to search transcripts.\n3. Summarizes performance based on retrieved data.",
