        "content": "### Phase 3: Vector Retrieval\n**Database:** Qdrant (`agent_transcripts` collection).\n**Embeddings:** Google Gemini.\n**Function:** Converts the user query into vectors, finds the most relevant call transcripts, and feeds them back to the AI.",
